<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-SEIZINGER WINS WORLD CUP SUPER-G.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-SEIZINGER WINS WORLD CUP SUPER-G.</headline>
<dateline>MAMMOTH LAKES, California 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Katja Seizinger of Germany won the women's World Cup super-g race at Mammoth Mountain on Friday.  </p>
<p>Hilde Gerg of German was second and Pernilla Wiberg of Sweden finished third, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>The results were declared official.</p>
